{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/t20250702_1334899.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:58.115297+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/t20250702_1334899.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h2>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营通知</h2>\n<p>发布时间：2025-07-02</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>为进一步加强各高校优秀在校大学生对武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院的了解，激发学生的科研热情，拓宽学生的学术视野，为有志于在武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院深造的学生提供互动交流和学习的平台，现面向全国</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营。</span></span><br/></p><p><strong><span>一、简介</span></strong></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院是我国材料科学与工程学科人才培养、科学研究的重要基地之一。过去</span></span><span><span><span>70</span></span></span><span><span>多年中，为国家建材、汽车与交通行业培养了近</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>万名卓越人才，荣获</span></span><span><span><span>23</span></span></span><span><span>项国家科技奖励，提供了</span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span><span><span>余项重大科技成果，攻克了港珠澳大桥、重点武器装备、四代核电、大推力运载火箭、</span></span><span><span><span>C919</span></span></span><span><span>大飞机、新型燃料电池等材料工程应用领域系列“卡脖子”技术难题，在能源转换新材料及其变革性技术、生物仿生制备复合结构陶瓷、高性能储能器件、新一代高效光催化材料等前沿领域取得突破，为建材工业由弱变强做出了重要贡献，为国防工业、新材料产业和区域经济发展提供了重要支撑。</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/6970e6ad53d507d38a97.jpg\" title=\"\"/></p><p><span><span>材料科学与工程学科于</span></span><span><span><span>1988</span></span></span><span><span>年被列为首批国家重点学科，</span></span><span><span><span>1996</span></span></span><span><span>年被列为国家“</span></span><span><span><span>211</span></span></span><span><span>工程”重点建设学科，</span></span><span><span><span>2007</span></span></span><span><span>年被列为一级学科国家重点学科，</span></span><span><span><span>2017</span></span></span><span><span>年入选首批国家“双一流”建设学科，</span></span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span><span><span>年入选第二轮国家“双一流”建设学科，</span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>ESI</span></span></span><span><span>国际影响力排名世界前</span></span><span><span><span>0.203‰</span></span></span><span><span>，位居全球第</span></span><span><span><span>31</span></span></span><span><span>位。学科拥有材料复合新技术全国重点实验室、硅酸盐科学与先进建材全国重点实验室、先进玻璃材料全国重点实验室、高温轻合金及应用技术全国重点实验室、光纤传感技术与网络国家工程研究中心、材料研究与测试中心、材料科学与工程实验教学中心等</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>个国家级平台，以及特种功能材料技术教育部重点实验室等</span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span>个省部级平台。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学科建设了一支以院士、国家重大科技计划首席科学家、全球高被引科学家等为学术带头人，整体科研能力强、结构合理、富于创新的学术队伍，拥有国家自然科学基金委创新群体、教育部创新团队、科技部重点领域创新团队、国防科技创新团队、湖北省创新群体等国家和省部级团队</span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span>余支。学科现有专任教师</span></span><span><span><span>350</span></span></span><span><span>余人，其中硕导</span></span><span><span><span>331</span></span></span><span><span>人、博导</span></span><span><span><span>217</span></span></span><span><span>人。包括中国科学院院士</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>人、中国工程院院士</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>人，国家教学名师</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>人，</span></span><span><span><span>35</span></span></span><span><span>名国家级高层次人才和</span></span><span><span><span>38</span></span></span><span><span>名国家级高层次青年人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院秉持“尚德启智、开物铸材”的院训，依托“材料科学与工程”一级学科国家重点学科办学，拥有材料科学与工程一级学科博士点和博士后流动站、材料与化工专业学位博士点和纳米科学与工程一级交叉学科博士点，是我国材料学科人才培养规模位居前列、行业特色鲜明的高层次人才培养基地。以行业企业或个人设立</span></span><span><span><span>80</span></span></span><span><span>余项奖助学金，近</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>年社会奖学金签约金额</span></span><span><span><span>2000</span></span></span><span><span>余万元，累计发放</span></span><span><span><span>800</span></span></span><span><span>余万元；近</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>年研究生就业率约为</span></span><span><span><span>97.8%</span></span></span><span><span>，主要进入中国建材、中国铁建、三一重工、中国航天科工、中国船舶、宝武集团等具有行业背景的大型国企，以及华为、比亚迪、华工科技、潮州三环、长飞光纤、长江存储等材料战略性新兴产业企业。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>具体招生专业及研究方向如下：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4ea2abd97389f3d691a1.png\" title=\"\"/><br/></p><p><strong><span>二、具体安排</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.</span>申报时间<span><span><span>：</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>开营时间：</span></span></strong><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span><span>11</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span>.</span>活动安排</strong></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/56f3b022f4f573f3ad97.png\" title=\"\"/><br/></p><p>注：本日程为拟定计划，具体安排后期可能会根据实际情况进行适当调整；营员报到后要求全程参加所有活动。</p><p><strong><span>4.</span>入营名单公示：</strong>我院将于学院官网公示入营名单。</p><p><span><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.2026</span></span></span><span><span>届全日制本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>诚实守信，身心健康，学风端正，无学业学术行为不端记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩和综合素质优秀，</span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>主修专业必修课程平均学分绩点在</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>及</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>以上</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>或</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span>必修课程平均成绩为主修专业前</span></span><span><span><span>30%</span></span></span><span><span>或综合测评成绩为主修专业前</span></span><span><span><span>30%，<span>且</span><span>无不及格课程</span></span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span><span>CET-4</span></span></span><span><span>成绩在</span></span><span><span><span>425</span></span></span><span><span>分及以上（小语种参照上述标准执行）；</span></span><span><span>能达到所在高校推荐免试生要求；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>对所报专业领域的科学研究有浓厚兴趣，有较强的科研潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span>在本科阶段具有突出科研成果或专业特长者，予以优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>四、申请程序</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.</span>网上报名</strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>本届夏令营活动采取网上报名的方式。凡欲申请本次夏令营活动的各高校优秀学子，请于规定时间在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”（</span></span><span><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325Wxin4</span></span></span><span><span>）报名并上传“申请资料”附件。未于规定时间在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”报名者，不予受理。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>2.</span>申请资料</strong></p><p>（<span>1</span>）本科成绩单和成绩排名证明（须加盖教务处或院系公章，<span>JPG</span>或<span>PDF</span>格式）；</p><p>（<span>2</span>）有效居民身份证正反面和学生证（含照片、学号页）；</p><p>（<span>3</span>）个人陈述（<span>800</span>字左右，无格式要求）；</p><p>（<span>4</span>）个人简历（<span>A4</span>一面，无格式要求）；</p><p>（<span>5</span>）外语水平证明（大学英语四、六级考试成绩，托福<span>/</span>雅思成绩或<span>GRE/GMAT</span>成绩等）；</p><p>（<span>6</span>）其他体现自身学术水平的代表性论文、获奖或其他原创性工作成果（如有）：</p><p>①\n以第一作者（或教师第一、学生第二）发表的高水平学术期刊论文（<span>SCI</span>、<span>EI</span>收录或北大中文核心期刊）的论文全文以及<span>JCR</span>期刊分区证明；</p><p>②\n在国家、省部级学术科技竞赛、创新发明竞赛荣获省部级三等奖及以上奖励证书；获授权发明专利，且排序在前<span>3</span>名的证书；</p><p>（<span>7</span>）本科期间获得校级及以上荣誉奖励证书或资格证书；</p><p>（<span>8</span>）申请人诚信承诺书（见附件）。</p><p>以上各项材料如有多页，请合并成一个<span>pdf</span>文件，扫描件要求清晰、工整；文件命名格式：姓名—选报专业方向—本科院校名称。</p><p><strong><span><span><span>注：以上材料原件将在入营时审核；对弄虚作假、提供不实信息的申请者，不论何时，一经发现查实，将取消其申请资格。</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong>五、其它说明</strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>夏令营期间，我院为营员提供免费餐食并购买人身意外保险。最终被我院拟录取的异地</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>非武汉市</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>高校学生（以</span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>月份全国研究生推免系统录取结果</span></span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生录取结果</span></span><span><span>为准），报销往返交通费（机票限经济舱、高铁或动车限二等座、火车限硬卧和硬座）及住宿费（请务必留好票据等报销凭证</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/t20250702_1334899.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>未尽事宜，欢迎致电</span></span><span><span><span><span>027-87164677</span></span></span></span><span><span>（净老师）</span></span><span><span>咨询。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院</strong></p><p><strong>2025年7月2日</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><span>附件：</span><a href=\"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/P020250702344698272311.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"诚信承诺书.pdf\"><span>诚信承诺书.pdf</span></a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"898d86dbf4cdb851f176814ed148c2dc076c61c3dc5b68f71c51ba83c493315c","textLength":2492,"sourceSha256":"343ebc16870186728f04124c64b339696bff2df8308b49fe58cd55a9ba733444","selector":"article-like:list_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1a4dd99bb2dc2879b72e","title":"2025年武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:58.115297+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/W020250702342119641832.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/6970e6ad53d507d38a97.jpg"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/W020250702342119656717.png","file":"assets/articles/media/4ea2abd97389f3d691a1.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202507/W020250702342119676360.png","file":"assets/articles/media/56f3b022f4f573f3ad97.png"}]}
